title trim page, silent take (peak under -60 dBFS) in FIT: no gain, chip "FIT", the bars stay flat
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_QUIET 0.0005
env CASSETTE_DEMO_WAVE_FIT 1

wait 600
shot trim-silent-fit
expect text "ZOOM"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
